 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication and roles
+
+Every request sends `Authorization: Bearer <key>` using a key from `apiKeys`
+in the data store. Missing or unknown keys return `401` (`unauthorized`);
+valid keys without permission return `403` (`forbidden`).
+
+- `viewer`: read-only (`GET` routes except `GET /audit`).
+- `cook`: `viewer` routes plus `POST /recipes/:id/cook`,
+  `POST /batches/:id/waste`, `POST /temperatures`, and
+  `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: all routes, including `GET /audit` (audit log of data-changing
+  requests, newest first).
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
